'''Reckoning''' is a [[special]] card.  It first appeared in [[The Lurker at the Threshold]] expansion.

When the [[Lurker at the Threshold (herald)|Lurker at the Threshold]] is being used as a [[herald]], a Reckoning card is drawn every time a [[gate]] opens (except for the gate which opens at the beginning of the game), or whenever a [[Dark Pact]] is taken. The described effects are immediately resolved in a fashion similar to [[Headline]]s.

